== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: tcvtrowps2phh [ENC: EVEX, MAP: 0F38, OPC: 0x6D]
     LENGTH:  6
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AMX_TILE
    ISA-SET: AMX_AVX512
    ISA-EXT: AMX_TILE
 EXCEPTIONS: AMXE8_EVEX
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 E2 1C 48 6D F9 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
